* Capacitance of the two RLCM MIM capacitors from the PDK model cap_mim_2f0_m4m5_noshield
* (2 fF/um2 MIM between Metal4 and Metal5). run_mim.py replaces CORNER with
* mimcap_typical, mimcap_ss or mimcap_ff.
.lib pdk/libs.tech/ngspice/sm141064.ngspice CORNER

* Structure 1: 100 um x 100 um top plate
v1 a1 0 dc 0 ac 1
x1 a1 0 cap_mim_2f0_m4m5_noshield c_width=100u c_length=100u
* Structure 2: 54 um x 25 um top plate
v2 a2 0 dc 0 ac 1
x2 a2 0 cap_mim_2f0_m4m5_noshield c_width=54u c_length=25u

.control
ac lin 1 1meg 1meg
let c1 = -imag(i(v1)) / (2 * pi * frequency)
let c2 = -imag(i(v2)) / (2 * pi * frequency)
echo "RESULT c1_pF $&c1 c2_pF $&c2"
.endc
.end
